        "original_id": "00ea98b8-06a1-57c8-86c0-29b7b59c0bed",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kendrick Lamar, DJ Dahi, Drake, Jay Rock, Big Sean, Ariana Grande, Dacoury Natchel, Michael Carlson, Leland Wayne\n- Songs: \"Money Trees\", \"Worst Behavior\", \"Research\"\n- Albums: Good Kid, M.A.A.D City, Section.80\n- Roles: producer, rapper, recording artist\n\nFacts:\n- In 2011, Kendrick Lamar released his debut studio album Section.80 exclusively through the iTunes Store as an independent album.\n- In 2012, Kendrick Lamar released Good Kid, M.A.A.D City as his second studio album.\n- The song \"Money Trees\" is by American hip hop recording artist Kendrick Lamar and appears on his major-label debut studio album Good Kid, M.A.A.D City.\n- \"Money Trees\" features Kendrick Lamar's label-mate Jay Rock.\n- DJ Dahi is noted for producing Drake's song \"Worst Behavior\" and Kendrick Lamar's acclaimed album track \"Money Trees\".\n- The song \"Research\" was written by Big Sean, Ariana Grande, Dacoury Natchel, Michael Carlson, and Leland Wayne, and it was produced by DJ Dahi and Metro Boomin.",
